entries[174271] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: Uncanny Combatant's Stormsteel Destroyer", ["text"] = "Rank 2\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft Uncanny Combatant's Stormsteel Destroyer more efficiently.\nReduce the materials required to craft an Uncanny Combatant's Stormsteel Destroyer.\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering (1)\nSell Price:\nAlliance\nUncanny Combatant's Stormsteel Destroyer\nBinds when equipped\nRanged Gun\n15 Damage Speed 3.00\n(5.0 damage per second)\n+7 Agility\n+10 Stamina\nDurability 120 / 120\nSell Price:\nHorde\nUncanny Combatant's Stormsteel Destroyer\nBinds when equipped\nRanged Gun\n15 Damage Speed 3.00\n(5.0 damage per second)\n+7 Agility\n+10 Stamina\nDurability 120 / 120\nSell Price:\nRequires Osmenite Ore (30), Storm Silver Ore (8), Insulated Wiring (18), Expulsom (6)" }
