entries[174289] = { ["name"] = "Selfless Collector's GreatHelm", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHead Plate\n37 Armor\n+15 [Strength or Intellect]\n+22 Stamina\n+ 18 Critical Strike\n+ 12 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nComplete Chapter 6 of your Covenant Campaign\n\nVestments of the Selfless (0/9)\nSelfless Collector's GreatHelm\nSelfless Collector's Chestplate\nSelfless Collector's Warboots\nSelfless Collector's Gauntlets\nSelfless Collector's Legguards\nSelfless Collector's Spaulders\nSelfless Collector's Girdle\nSelfless Collector's Wristguards\nSelfless Collector's Greatcloak\n(3) Set : Increases your out-of-combat regeneration in outdoor Shadowland zones. While in your Covenant's realm, the regeneration amount is increased.\n(5) Set : Phial of Serenity grants 70 Primary Stat for 30 sec. Removing a disease, poison, curse, or bleed increases the amount granted by 50%.\n(8) Set : Your spells and abilities have a chance to cause your target to erupt in a blinding light dealing 577 Arcane damage or healing an ally for 709 health.\nSell Price:" }
